{"unit_slug":"alter_self","verdict":"atom_widening","typecheck_exit":0,"tracer_exit":1,"harness_atoms":[],"harness_relations":[],"unknown_atoms":[],"unknown_relations":[],"claude_self_verdict":"atom_widening","claude_proposed_widenings":[{"kind":"new_atom","name":"selectable_form","justification":"Alter Self's core mechanic is a set of N mutually exclusive physical-form options. The caster picks one at cast and may use a Magic action during the duration to swap to a different option. OngoingOperation only has roll_modifier and damage_on_hit; neither captures 'choose one of N persistent form grants'. This is a new operation kind whose shape is a list of options plus an in-duration swap cost.","evidence":"You alter your physical form. Choose one of the following options. Its effects last for the duration, during which you can take a Magic action to replace the option you chose with a different one."},{"kind":"new_atom","name":"water_breathing","justification":"Aquatic Adaptation grants the ability to breathe underwater. No atom in the current vocabulary covers granting a breathing capability or environmental survival property.","evidence":"You sprout gills and grow webs between your fingers. You can breathe underwater..."},{"kind":"new_atom","name":"swim_speed_equals_speed","justification":"Aquatic Adaptation grants a Swim Speed equal to the caster's current Speed. This is a speed-referential grant (not a fixed-feet bonus). No grant_movement_type or speed_referential_grant atom exists in v4.","evidence":"...and gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed."},{"kind":"new_atom","name":"modify_unarmed_strike","justification":"Natural Weapons replaces the Unarmed Strike's damage die (→ 1d6), selects a damage type from {Slashing, Piercing, Bludgeoning}, and substitutes the spellcasting ability modifier for Strength on attack and damage rolls. This changes the BASE attack property, not adds a damage rider — it is not damage_on_hit. No modify_unarmed_strike or base_attack_property_override atom exists.","evidence":"When you use your Unarmed Strike to deal damage with that new growth, it deals 1d6 damage of the type in parentheses instead of dealing the normal damage for your Unarmed Strike, and you use your spellcasting ability modifier for the attack and damage rolls rather than using Strength."},{"kind":"new_atom","name":"physical_appearance_change","justification":"Change Appearance grants the capability to alter physical appearance (height, weight, facial features, voice, hair, coloration, apparent species within same size/shape). It is a named mechanical capability reachable via the in-duration swap. While its consequences are partly adjudicated, the capability grant itself needs an atom so the graph has somewhere to point.","evidence":"You alter your appearance. You decide what you look like, including your height, weight, facial features, sound of your voice, hair length, coloration, and other distinguishing characteristics. You can make yourself appear as a member of another species, though none of your statistics change."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"InDurationSwapCost on selectable_form","justification":"The ability to swap between form options mid-duration at the cost of a Magic action has no structural home. StandardActionKind already includes 'magic', but there is no InDurationActionCost concept or mid-effect swap structure in the surface. The selectable_form operation needs a switchCost field of this kind.","evidence":"...during which you can take a Magic action to replace the option you chose with a different one."}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["claude claimed atom 'spell_root' not in tracer output","claude claimed atom 'activate' not in tracer output","claude claimed atom 'action_quota' not in tracer output","claude claimed atom 'spell_slot' not in tracer output","claude claimed atom 'concentration_lock' not in tracer output","claude claimed atom 'concentrate' not in tracer output","claude claimed atom 'expire' not in tracer output","claude claimed atom 'self' not in tracer output"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/interpreter/tracer.ts:509\n      throw new Error(`unhandled ongoing operation: ${String(_)}`);\n            ^\n\n\nError: unhandled ongoing operation: [object Object]\n    at traceOngoingOperation (/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/interpreter/tracer.ts:509:13)\n    at traceOngoingEffect (/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/interpreter/tracer.ts:382:3)\n    at traceSpellMechanics (/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/interpreter/tracer.ts:163:7)\n    at traceSpellUnit (/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/interpreter/tracer.ts:118:23)\n    at traceUnit (/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/interpreter/tracer.ts:83:14)\n    at main (/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/run.ts:31:17)\n    at <anonymous> (/workspace/typescript/dnd/scripts/content-surface-survey/workers/34059-alter_self/src/run.ts:49:1)\n    at ModuleJob.run (node:internal/modules/esm/module_job:325:25)\n    at async ModuleLoader.import (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:606:24)\n    at async asyncRunEntryPointWithESMLoader (node:internal/modules/run_main:117:5)\n\nNode.js v20.20.1\n","wall_seconds":2.13}

{"unit_slug":"animal_friendship","verdict":"atom_widening","typecheck_exit":0,"tracer_exit":0,"harness_atoms":["action_quota","activate","expire","persist","save_gate","scale_target_count","spell_root","spell_slot","target"],"harness_relations":["attaches_to","consumes","grants","modifies","persists_until","roots"],"unknown_atoms":[],"unknown_relations":[],"claude_self_verdict":"atom_widening","claude_proposed_widenings":[{"kind":"new_variant","name":"Effect.apply_condition","justification":"The on-fail branch of the WIS save must apply the Charmed condition for the duration. The spell Effect type only has `damage` and `none`; there is no `apply_condition` variant for spells. The `apply_condition` atomKind already exists in v4 (mastery SaveGateRiderResult in tracer.ts:1635), but it is not surfaced in the spell Effect union. Adding it here is the minimum widening needed to express this spell's core outcome.","evidence":"The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"Condition.charmed","justification":"The Condition type currently only contains `'prone'`. Animal Friendship inflicts `charmed`, which is not present. This widening is prerequisite for the apply_condition Effect variant above.","evidence":"The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration."},{"kind":"new_atom","name":"creature_type_filter","justification":"The spell is explicitly restricted to Beast targets. No creature type predicate exists anywhere in Attachment, TargetSelection, or any related type. Encoding this as a free-text description field loses it entirely from the machine-readable graph. A new atom (or new field on TargetSelection) is needed to record 'Beast only' as a closed predicate.","evidence":"Target a Beast that you can see within range."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"Duration.conditional_timed","justification":"The spell has a timed 24-hour duration that terminates early if a specific event fires (caster or ally deals damage to the target). The current Duration variants — instantaneous, concentration, timed — have no conditional early-termination hook. A new variant encoding a trigger-on-event expiry is needed.","evidence":"If you or one of your allies deals damage to the target, the spell ends."}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":[],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":2.471}

