{"unit_slug":"call_lightning","verdict":"structural_widening","typecheck_exit":0,"tracer_exit":0,"harness_atoms":["action_quota","activate","area","concentrate","concentration_lock","damage","expire","save_gate","scale_die_count","spell_root","spell_slot"],"harness_relations":["attaches_to","branches_on_save","consumes","grants","modifies","persists_until","roots"],"unknown_atoms":[],"unknown_relations":[],"claude_self_verdict":"structural_widening","claude_proposed_widenings":[{"kind":"new_subgraph","name":"repeatable_activation spell family","justification":"The spell's defining mechanic is a cost-gated repeatable activation within a concentration spell: while concentrating, the caster spends a Magic action each turn to fire a save_gate on an area. No existing family models this. ongoing_effect only supports passive OngoingOperation riders (roll_modifier, damage_on_hit). activation is one-shot. A new family — tentatively 'repeatable_activation' — is needed with fields: { duration: concentration | timed; actionCost: StandardActionKind; phases: ActivationPhase[] }. The tracer would need a new procedureForFamily case and a new trace path emitting an on_turn_window (or magic_action_window) gating the phases.","evidence":"Until the spell ends, you can take a Magic action to call down lightning in that way again, targeting the same point or a different one."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"half_of_fail_damage Effect variant","justification":"Effect = DamageEffect | NoneEffect. Call Lightning deals half damage on a successful save. The encoding uses onSuccess: none, which is inaccurate. A new Effect variant { kind: 'half_of_fail_damage' } is needed for save-half spells (Fireball, Thunderwave, etc. share this pattern).","evidence":"taking 3d10 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one."}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":[],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":1.587}

{"unit_slug":"chain_lightning","verdict":"invalid","typecheck_exit":-1,"tracer_exit":-1,"harness_atoms":[],"harness_relations":[],"unknown_atoms":[],"unknown_relations":[],"claude_self_verdict":null,"claude_proposed_widenings":[],"claude_confidence":null,"discrepancies":["missing content/chain_lightning.json"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0}

